    "Six existing shared256px limestone,stucco,granite,paintedmetal,slate andwindow-grid graphs;seven mergedsemanticgroups because metalroof andstructuralmetal retain distinctslots. MetricUVs,linearcolors,no private/embeddedimages. Skyline keepswholehall,allpavilions andcourtopenings. Districtaddscoarsearchedglazing andcornices. Streetaddsrealrecesses,archmouldings androofribs. Close-upaddscolumns,archedmullions,dormers andmansardrails;master separatelyrefinescurves andwindowframes. LODerrorvalues areestimates.",
